#: models.py:208
msgid ""
"Whether a person who has not accepted this document is stopped until they "
"do, on a site that has switched the check on. Turn it off for a document "
"that is published and offered but never required, such as a cookie policy. "
"It never applies to a notice."
msgstr ""
"Whether a person who has not accepted this document is stopped until they "
"do, on a site that has switched the check on. Turn it off for a document "
"that is published and offered but never required, such as a cookie policy. "
"It never applies to a notice."

